{"title":"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each pair of real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/4/af40dd462cfac9a98f63c84a474236829d0b3c25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\neq b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />, define the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17950ad2ab63c764778b133f95a03dcf2969d57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\star$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74d9344dab3ec93518b1f12276a642d901688dbb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a \\star b) = \\frac{a+b}{a-b}.\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c96d2265fd92d9330d54468f19c32fc061e0f65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((1 \\star 2) \\star 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c9aa87ab006d652cb09be8fcd8e07d35696cf2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -\\frac{2}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } -\\frac{1}{5}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 0\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\text{This value is not defined.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"586\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/755b53b6f3d57c8f8f8214eebcda0ad68d4d0415.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((1 \\star 2) \\star 3) = \\left(\\left(\\frac{1+2}{1-2}\\right) \\star 3\\right) = (-3 \\star 3) = \\frac{-3+3}{-3-3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"489\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5g_m3_nck8E\">https://youtu.be/5g_m3_nck8E</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6FnnFTWUJ0s\">https://youtu.be/6FnnFTWUJ0s</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A\">2005 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n